GUI theme and icons (D-067)
---------------------------
The GUI theme tokens (gui/src/theme/tokens.css, block marked "verbatim") and the
following 16x16 icons in gui/public/icons/ are copied from CyberSprite, a project
by the same author (kokuren333), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Original files: CyberSprite gui/src/theme/tokens.css and gui/public/icons/<name>.png
(icon originals: CyberSprite assets/ui/icons/<name>.csprite).

  add, agent, error, first, folder, grid, human, info, link, lock, pause, play,
  remove, settings, sources, undo, validate-ok, warning

The icons chain, download, export, headphones, meter, model, report, separate,
stem and waveform are original MankoMIX work in the same 11-colour palette,
drawn by tools/make_icons.py with the CyberSprite CLI. Per-file provenance and
SHA-256 hashes are in gui/public/icons/manifest.json.
